  "about": "What scripts/fonts/build.sh reads and writes. Sources are pinned by URL, sha256 and size: the shipped fonts and their licenses, and fonts measured only to fit the fallback faces. Outputs are recorded by build.sh --write, and test/fonts.test.ts fails when a committed file differs from its line here.",
